=== jquery-ui ===

The asset build uses the jquery-ui npm package for all modules except slider.js.
PastVu keeps its patched slider here.

The asset build also uses the npm package for the Smoothness theme, with
PastVu's typography and slider dimensions in public/style/jquery/ui/.

=== Local changes to jquery-ui ===

08/12/22

Added patch to fix slider widget issues when both sliders are set to the same
year. See #532 for details.
